## ARCHITECTURE (Glm5NextForConditionalGeneration)
- num_hidden_layers: 45
- n_routed_experts: 288
- num_experts_per_tok: 8
- Sparse MLP layers: 42 (indices 3-44)
- Dense MLP layers: 3 (indices 0-2)
- Attention: Hybrid linear_attention (first 3 layers) + deepseek_sparse_attention (every 4th layer)
- MLA: q_lora_rank=1536, kv_lora_rank=512
- Precision: bfloat16
- Quantization: e4m3 (experts only)
- Total parameters: 320B (18B active per token)
- Vision encoder: YES (GLM-5.3-Flash is vision-capable)

## CRITICAL COMPATIBILITY NOTE ⚠️
Tensor naming convention: `model.language_model.*` (NOT `model.*`)
This is DIFFERENT from GLM-5.2 which uses `model.*` directly.

Colibri v1.10.2 currently supports:
  - glm_moe_dsa (GLM-5.2/5.3 base)
  - deepseek_v4 (DeepSeek-V3/V2)
  - inkling, olmoe, kimi_k3, qwen38

Glm5Next is a NEW variant. Tensor name mapping may be needed:
  - GLM-5.3-Flash: model.language_model.layers.N.*  (language_model prefix)
  - Colibri expects: model.layers.N.* (no prefix)

